<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FLOWSERVE STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FLOWSERVE STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Flowserve Corp as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $42 to $45 a share.</p>
<p>-- Flowserve was created by the merger of Durco International Inc and BW/IP Inc, which closed last month.</p>
<p>-- said by joining forces, these companies &quot;offer a broader array of products and services with greater global reach and penetration.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Flowserve gained 13/16 to 34-3/4.</p>
</text>
